<title>GERMANY: Buba revises up German Jan industry output.</title>
<headline>Buba revises up German Jan industry output.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures for German industry output:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT	Jan 97	   Dec 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -1.5	     +0.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +2.0	     +2.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    98.1 (97.9)    99.6</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.1	     +0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +1.9	     +2.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    96.1 (95.5)    96.0</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	-14.3	     +3.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +1.6	    +10.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   124.9 (126.2)  145.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
